</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/dc61a080-7d67-11f1-82a3-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-08T082618Z-999574704-RC2BMEAHLDUO-RTRMADP-3-AUTOS-CHINA-SALES.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/dc61a080-7d67-11f1-82a3-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-08T082618Z-999574704-RC2BMEAHLDUO-RTRMADP-3-AUTOS-CHINA-SALES.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">e37b47fe-7d67-11f1-90f9-8bb63e6165bf</guid><pubDate>Sat, 11 Jul 2026 20:34:25 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/dc61a080-7d67-11f1-82a3-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-08T082618Z-999574704-RC2BMEAHLDUO-RTRMADP-3-AUTOS-CHINA-SALES.jpg">REUTERS - Annegret Hilse</source><dc:creator>柏林特约记者 丹兰</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>中国宣布首次成功回收可重复使用火箭</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260711-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%83%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E5%9B%9E%E6%94%B6%E5%8F%AF%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%81%AB%E7%AE%AD</link><description>
