</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/fa0a8592-ecdb-11f0-b49c-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2025-12-31T011553Z-827378250-RC2NFGAYZT27-RTRMADP-3-BYTEDANCE-NVIDIA-CHIPS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/fa0a8592-ecdb-11f0-b49c-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2025-12-31T011553Z-827378250-RC2NFGAYZT27-RTRMADP-3-BYTEDANCE-NVIDIA-CHIPS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">43855f26-7b70-11f1-993b-31c0beb6d383</guid><pubDate>Thu, 09 Jul 2026 08:47:06 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/fa0a8592-ecdb-11f0-b49c-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2025-12-31T011553Z-827378250-RC2NFGAYZT27-RTRMADP-3-BYTEDANCE-NVIDIA-CHIPS.jpg">© 路透社图片</source><dc:creator>弗林</dc:creator></item></channel></rss>
